        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions ATC150SS6, Arctic Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arctic Door Handle with Stainless Steel Brackets is available in several lengths: 18 inches, 24 inches, 36 inches--all the way up to 84 inches! The pull itself is made out of acrylic manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and the mounts are made out of stainless steel. Choose from polished stainless steel, satin stainless steel, or powder coated matte black for the bracket.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary design acrylic pull handle can be used on glass doors, store front doors, commercial office entry doors—-any door where a clean, contemporary large door handle is required. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Arctic Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATC02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262325\"><b>First Impressions ATC150SS6  Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>ATC150018SS6:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>ATC150024SS6:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>ATC150036SS6:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>ATC150048SS6:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" VALIGN=\"top\" >\r\n<b>ATC150060SS6:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>ATC150072SS6:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>ATC150084SS6:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 84\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>",
