                "description": "The Arctic Door Handle with Stainless Steel Brackets is available in 3 lengths: 18 inches, 24 inches, and 36 inches. The pull itself is made out of acrylic manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and the mounts are made out of stainless steel. Choose from polished stainless steel, satin stainless steel, or powder coated matte black for the bracket.\r\n",
